Summon this Spirit card. Then, you can set a card with Burst effects from your Hand.

[LV1][LV2] (When Summoned)
Return an opposing Spirit to their Hand.

[LV2] {{ua|Red}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Red Spirit/Ultimate/Nexus/Magic effects.

{{Sumcon|You control one or more Purple Spirits}}

{{Burst|After your Spirit/Ultimate is destroyed by the Opponent}}
You can summon an "Evil Shadow" family Spirit card from your Trash. After this effect resolves, summon this Ultimate card.

Ultimate Trigger [LV4][LV5] (Start of Opposing Attack Step)
When Ultimate Trigger hits, during this turn, all opposing Spirits with cards under them can't attack.
