{{Sumcon|You control one or more Green Spirits}}

{{Burst|After your Spirit/Ultimate is destroyed by the Opponent}}
Summon this Ultimate card. Then, if your Hand is two or less, exhaust all opposing Spirits.

Ultimate Trigger [LV4] (When Attacks)
When Ultimate Trigger hits, refresh all your Spirits.
utb

{{Sumcon|You control one or more Blue Spirits}}

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
Destroy two opposing Spirits with Rush. After this effect resolves, summon this Ultimate card.

Ultimate Trigger [LV4] (When Attacks)
When Ultimate Trigger hits, the (Opposing Main Step) of next turn doesn't occur. This effect can only be used once per game.
utb

{{Sumcon|You control one or more Purple Spirits}}

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
Summon this Ultimate card. Then, if your Life is at two or less, send two cores from any opposing Spirits to the Void.

Ultimate Trigger [LV4][LV5] (When Attacks)
When Ultimate Trigger hits, destroy an opposing exhausted Spirit/Ultimate. When any Spirit is destroyed by this effect, send an opposing Life to their Reserve.
utb

{{Sumcon|You control one or more Cost 3 or higher Spirits/Ultimates}}

{{Burst|After an opposing Spirit/Ultimate attacks}}
If your Life is at three or less, return an opposing Spirit to the decktop. After this effect resolves, summon this Ultimate card without paying the cost.

Ultimate Trigger [LV4][LV5] (When Attacks)
When Ultimate Trigger hits, this Ultimate can't be blocked by opposing Spirits. Once per turn, when this Ultimate reduces the opposing Life, it refreshes.
utb

{{sumcon|You control one or more Yellow Spirits/Ultimates}}

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
Put a core from the Void to your Life. During this turn, all opposing Spirits can't attack. After this effect resolves, summon this card without paying the cost.

Ultimate Trigger [LV4][LV5] (When Attacks)
When Ultimate Trigger hits, return every opposing LV2 Spirit to the Hand. When any Spirit is returned to the Hand by this effect, send an opposing Life to their Reserve.
utb

{{Sumcon|You control one or more Red Spirits}}

{{Burst|After your Life is reduced}}
If your Life is at three or less, destroy an opposing 20000 BP or less Ultimate. After this effect resolves, summon this Ultimate card.

Ultimate Trigger [LV4][LV5][LV6] (When Attacks)
When Ultimate Trigger hits, during this turn, when your Ultimates are blocked by opposing Spirits, send an opposing Life to their Reserve.
